{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c3a5b799-7c99-8e05-ab25-192741ef0d3b",
  "created_at": "2026-03-10T11:05:02-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Morales",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:59:42-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you this morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:59:48-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Bottom line, I need somebody who actually knows drains to come look at the one on our corner. Not another guy with a shovel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T10:59:59-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Let's get you set up. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:03-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "688 Thames Street. Fifth Ward, down past the Wellington end. My mother's house. I'm Luis, Luis Morales, I'm her son."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:12-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "688 Thames. Morales. Hang on, let me pull it up. [pause] Okay, I've got history on this one. January, the drain backup at the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:22-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. So you can add another one to that history. Basement flooded again. Second time this winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:29-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no. With the rain over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:33-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Friday night into Saturday. My mother goes down Saturday morning, there's about five inches of water down there. Five. Last time it was three, so, you know, we're making progress."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:45-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Where's it getting in? Same spot as before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:00:49-04:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same spot. The bulkhead door. Nothing new, it's not coming up through the floor or anything, it's the bulkhead, same as January. The whole block drains toward that corner, the street just tips that way, and the grate down there looks plugged. Water sits, comes up over the curb, runs right down the driveway to the bulkhead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:12-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And did anything get damaged this time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:16-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Same stuff as last time. The camping gear, which, I'm about done drying that out, and the chest freezer sitting in water again. Nothing else got hit, at least. But that's twice for the freezer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:30-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Same items, nothing new affected. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:35-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Here's my issue, though. After the first one, we were told somebody was going to look at the drain. And nobody looked at the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:45-04:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do have a crew out there on January thirtieth. Says they cleared the grate and cleaned out silt around the catch basin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:01:55-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. The top. They cleaned the top. My mother said they were there maybe, what, a little while, scraped the grate, shoveled the junk off, gone. Nobody looked at what's under it. That's not looking at the drain, that's sweeping."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:11-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. The note does say grate and basin top only."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:17-04:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So whatever's wrong is down in the line, and it's still wrong. Which is why I want a supervisor or an engineer out there. Somebody who can say, okay, this pipe's busted, or it's too small, whatever it is. I don't want the same crew coming back to do the same five minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:38-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Here's what I can do. I'm logging this as a repeat backup at the same location, so it's flagged, not a fresh ticket. I can get a crew out Thursday, and I'm going to note they need to go into the line, not just the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:57-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thursday. This Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:02:59-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This Thursday, the twelfth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:02-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. And the supervisor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:05-04:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm putting in for a supervisor callback, and I'm asking for it by Friday. They'll be the one to say whether it goes to engineering. What's a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:18-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My cell. 401-555-0164."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:20-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0164. And that's Luis, L-U-I-S?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:23-04:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:24-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. You'll want to pick up for numbers you don't know Friday, it might come from a desk line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:32-04:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm on jobs all day, but I'll grab it. Look, I'm not trying to give you a hard time. It's just, of all weeks. My mother-in-law's up visiting from out of state this week, and she's staying with us, and I'm supposed to be showing her around, and instead I'm over at my mother's with a wet vac and fans."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:56-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's lousy timing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:03:58-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tell me about it. She thinks it's very funny. I don't."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:03-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, hopefully by the time she's heading home you've at least got a crew that's been in that line. Anything else I should put in the notes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:14-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just that it's the corner, the grate right at the corner, not the one up the street. Last time I don't know if they even knew which one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:26-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put corner grate, catch basin nearest 688, block drains to it. That'll be clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:33-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. And if it rains before Thursday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:37-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Call us right away if the grate backs up again. Even if it's just standing water, call, and reference the repeat backup. It all goes on the same record."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:49-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thursday crew, supervisor by Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:52-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Thursday crew, supervisor call by Friday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:56-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thanks, Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-10T11:04:58-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Good luck with the drying out."
    }
  ],
